Remote Backend

Configured an S3 backend to store Terraform state remotely.

terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket       = "terraweek-state-mukesh-2026"
    key          = "dev/terraform.tfstate"
    region       = "ap-south-1"
    encrypt      = true
    use_lockfile = true
  }
}

Key Learning

Terraform State helps Terraform track the infrastructure it manages.

Remote state with S3 provides centralized state storage and S3 versioning helps keep previous versions of the state.

